    {
      "id": "0N6lIYy1h11lhpgAE1oWn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 311.87890625,
      "y": 33.5,
      "width": 1267.2392578125,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1T",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 360382991,
      "version": 40,
      "versionNonce": 1847188541,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1785519299890,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n\n1. Correctness problems happen when shared state gets corrupted. \nTwo threads both check that a seat is available, both see yes, both book it. One booking gets lost.\n\n2. Coordination problems happen when threads need to hand off work or wait for each other. \nA producer adds tasks to a queue, consumers process them. \nIf the queue is empty, consumers need to wait efficiently without burning CPU. If the queue is full, producers need to slow down.\n\n3. Scarcity problems happen when resources are limited. You have 10 database connections but 100 concurrent requests.\nSome requests must wait.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n\n1. Correctness problems happen when shared state gets corrupted. \nTwo threads both check that a seat is available, both see yes, both book it. One booking gets lost.\n\n2. Coordination problems happen when threads need to hand off work or wait for each other. \nA producer adds tasks to a queue, consumers process them. \nIf the queue is empty, consumers need to wait efficiently without burning CPU. If the queue is full, producers need to slow down.\n\n3. Scarcity problems happen when resources are limited. You have 10 database connections but 100 concurrent requests.\nSome requests must wait.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
